Z||000000||Red2m4||10-01-2001||01:23 AM||||<BR>I went to visit a friend of mine at work on saturday. Parked in front of his store was a corvette convertible. (looked like a '98) Only problem was that it had only 3 tires.  It was just sitting on the rim, with a small strip of the tires remains wrapped around it. He said it'd been there since he had gotten there.  The 'vette owner showed up and we asked him what happened.  He said he'd been putting fix-a-flat in the tire for 2 weeks.  (3 cans worth!) And that the night before he'd been on the expressway, when it went completely flat.  He then drove it a half mile off the expressway, and left it in the parking lot.  (who knows how far he had to drive to get to an exit. )<P>A man that stupid has no right to own such a fine automobile.||||reg||1
